<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Scottish league and</p>
<p>cup soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scottish Cup second round</p>
<p> East Stirling	 4    Brora Rangers	 3</p>
<p>(East Stirling away to Kilmarnock in third round)</p>
<p> Spartans		0    Arbroath		0</p>
<p> Whitehill	     2    Queen of the South  3</p>
<p>(Queen of the South away to Dundee)</p>
<p>Postponed: Ross County v Montrose, Stranraer v Inverness C.</p>
<p>Thistle</p>
<p>Premier division</p>
<p> Dunfermline	   1    Dundee United	 3</p>
<p> Hearts		  1    Celtic		  2</p>
<p> Kilmarnock	    0    Raith		   1</p>
<p> Motherwell	    2    Hibernian	     1</p>
<p>Playing Sunday: Rangers v Aberdeen</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Clydebank	     v    St Mirren	     postponed</p>
<p> Dundee		  2    Airdrieonians	 1</p>
<p> Greenock Morton     2    East Fife	     0</p>
